# CFA-GNN Proof on SARD — Technical Implementation Plan

**Milestone:** M1 — Prove CFA + GGNN works on SARD before full data collection
**Goal:** Binary F1 ≥ 0.85; CFA pairwise accuracy ≥ 0.80 on SARD data
**Duration:** 3–4 weeks | **Total Stories:** 8

