### Production Issues
| Issue | Impact | Fix |
|-------|--------|-----|
| `tree-sitter>=0.22` API breaking change | Old code uses `Language.build_library()`. New API uses `Language(tsc.language())` | Update all tree-sitter usage to new API — do NOT mix old and new |
| Joern JVM default heap 512MB | OOM on 200+ line functions | Set `_JAVA_OPTIONS="-Xmx4g"` in `.env` or shell profile |
| `torch-geometric` version mismatch with CUDA | GatedGraphConv might not exist in very old PyG | Use `>=2.4.0` and verify `from torch_geometric.nn import GatedGraphConv` |

