### 8.7 Expected M1 Results

| Config | Expected F1 | Expected Pairwise Acc | What It Proves |
|--------|-------------|----------------------|----------------|
| B: No CFA | ~0.80 | N/A | Baseline performance |
| C: + CFA | ~0.85–0.87 | ~0.80 | **CFA improves F1 by ≥3%** |
